      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\u271d\ufe0f\ud83d\udc23 He is Risen!\n\nWishing a you all a peaceful, blessed and happy Easter Sunday from me and mine to you and yours.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2040794337722671603",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-05T14:11:00+00:00",
