    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Incredible. Kick these monsters out of our country. \n\nHow the hell did they even get a visa to stay here to begin with?!\n\n\nSecretary Marco Rubio (@SecRubio)\n\nUntil recently, Hamideh Soleimani Afshar and her daughter were green card holders living lavishly in the United States.\n\nAfshar is the niece of deceased Iranian Major General Qasem Soleimani. She is also an outspoken supporter of the Iranian regime who celebrated attacks on Americans and referred to our country as the \"Great Satan.\"\n\nThis w",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2040571605126889815",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-04T23:25:57+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Of no surprise to anyone this is not at all how we are going to raise our son. I\u2019m so sick of liberal women shaming boys for being born boys.\n\n\nElection Wizard (@ElectionWiz)\n\nDISTURBING: Gavin Newsom\u2019s wife on how she raises her son:\n\n\u201cI've given our boys dolls\u2026\n\nif I'm reading a book and the protagonist is a male, I just change the 'he' to a 'she.'\u201d\n\nVideo\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/ElectionWiz/status/2040026735916327259#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2040062112341340296",
